    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d905">

                <pb facs="0739" n="663" sameAs="frus:frus1916/pg663"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 312.115C96/81</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        Special Agent Silliman
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-01-31T15:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 31, 1916, 3 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Department receiving complaints that little or nothing is being done to apprehend
                    guilty parties connected with Santa Ysabel massacre. Reported none of guilty has
                    yet been captured.</p>
                <pb facs="0740" n="664" xml:id="pg664"/>
                <p>Make discreet inquiry with a view to ascertaining just what is being done to
                    capture and punish murderers.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
